_type": "primary", "author": "欧阳修", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/1077369385e2f45f53fcb123c439df6b8e4a0f85/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0959/part-03/sources/library/xinwudaishi-20-fu-younger-queen/source.txt", "note": "《新五代史》卷二十，段落 xin-wudaishi-b08f244b9241-p000665；EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核", "id": "1be7e0c3-558e-5580-9f1a-423f21abad82"}, {"title": "新五代史·卷二十", "source_type": "primary", "author": "欧阳修", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/1077369385e2f45f53fcb123c439df6b8e4a0f85/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0959/part-03/sources/library/xinwudaishi-20-sons-959/source.txt", "note": "《新五代史》卷二十，段落 xin-wudaishi-b08f244b9241-p000669；EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核", "id": "33fec61f-8a07-5919-8420-afec0dd857d2"}, {"title": "资治通鉴·后周纪五", "source_type": "primary", "author": "司马光等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/052a8074ed5386bf0e6e93afa0652e5c64213b7e/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0959/part-02/sources/library/tongjian-294-959-north-return/source.txt", "note": "《资治通鉴》后周纪五，段落 zizhi-tongjian-a63549944a71-p003493；电子底本待考，分段待核", "id": "369bb07b-44cd-5100-9c00-fe3945faf928"}, {"title": "旧五代史·卷一百十九", "source_type": "primary", "author": "薛居正等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/052a8074ed5386bf0e6e93afa0652e5c64213b7e/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0959/part-02/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-119-june-959/source.txt", "note": "《旧五代史》卷一百十九，段落 jiu-wudaishi-205deb4a7860-p002801；EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核", "id": "e90d7a2f-c277-5e4e-82d8-8c92e03d9797"}, {"title": "旧五代史·卷一百十九", "source_type": "primary", "author": "薛居正等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/052a8074ed5386bf0e6e93afa0652e5c64213b7e/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0959/part-02/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-119-may-959/source.txt", "note": "《旧五代史》卷一百十九，段落 jiu-wudaishi-205deb4a7860-p002800；EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核", "id": "29ee8211-c4ac-549b-9af7-ca29e34fcc8f"}, {"title": "新五代史·卷十二", "source_type": "primary", "author": "欧阳修", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/d7f52d562d203b2a0ae571237b8530fe83e02856/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0959/part-01/sources/library/xinwudaishi-12-959/source.txt", "note": "《新五代史》卷十二，段落 xin-wudaishi-b08f244b9241-p000381；EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核", "id": "46ccc53b-5a04-5228-9747-031d9ca3c3a8"}]'::jsonb)
